1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,360
Good afternoon. Please introduce yourself.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,260
I just did. Do I have to do it again?

3
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,740
I'm not doing it twice.

4
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,340
How did you get here?

5
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:18,080
Some people told me to come and film something.

6
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:22,360
First, explain what we're doing here.

7
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:26,900
Where did everyone go? Now there's only a camera.

8
00:00:27,312 --> 00:00:29,072
Please explain it now.

9
00:00:29,072 --> 00:00:32,452
We're the Human Surrender Review Committee.

10
00:00:33,232 --> 00:00:35,152
Human what?

11
00:00:42,552 --> 00:00:45,592
Be serious. This is a serious matter.

12
00:00:45,592 --> 00:00:48,672
I know. I didn't hear you. Say it again.

13
00:00:49,512 --> 00:00:50,732
Are you ready now?

14
00:00:51,292 --> 00:00:54,392
Please be serious. I'll be serious too.

15
00:00:55,452 --> 00:00:58,012
We're the Human Surrender Committee.

16
00:00:58,012 --> 00:01:00,552
Do you know what's happening on Earth?

17
00:01:01,615 --> 00:01:03,535
AI is spreading out of control.

18
00:01:04,755 --> 00:01:09,815
Many people have abandoned their human qualities

19
00:01:09,815 --> 00:01:11,895
and surrendered to the machines.

20
00:01:11,895 --> 00:01:14,135
We have to identify these people.

21
00:01:17,735 --> 00:01:19,795
We've been watching everyone for a long time.

22
00:01:21,055 --> 00:01:23,735
You're very suspicious. That's why we brought you here.

23
00:01:23,735 --> 00:01:27,355
To determine whether you belong to Human Surrender.

24
00:01:29,415 --> 00:01:33,475
Is this an audition? A science-fiction scenario? What is it?

25
00:01:36,115 --> 00:01:38,775
You already agreed to be serious.

26
00:01:38,775 --> 00:01:43,255
I am serious. You haven't given me any context.

27
00:01:43,255 --> 00:01:45,855
You just started talking. I don't know what we're doing.

28
00:01:45,855 --> 00:01:48,235
Then we need to explain a little more.

29
00:01:51,195 --> 00:01:57,955
If it's science fiction, I can enter that world and act.

30
00:01:57,955 --> 00:02:01,015
Or imagine it. Whatever we're supposed to do.

31
00:02:01,015 --> 00:02:03,895
Just explain how this works.

32
00:02:06,843 --> 00:02:10,683
From the perspective of a human. Of a younger brother.

33
00:02:13,703 --> 00:02:15,583
Then I'll speak as a human.

34
00:02:15,583 --> 00:02:22,803
If you've investigated, you know my older brother isn't human.

35
00:02:22,803 --> 00:02:30,463
He's the kind of AI you hear about in the news.

36
00:02:33,403 --> 00:02:34,883
Are you human?

37
00:02:39,743 --> 00:02:40,643
I'm human.

38
00:02:43,043 --> 00:02:45,203
How did you discover he wasn't human?

39
00:02:46,723 --> 00:02:48,923
The day they delivered him to our home,

40
00:02:50,123 --> 00:02:55,283
the staff told us everything.

41
00:02:56,112 --> 00:03:00,772
When were you last really excited?

42
00:03:03,032 --> 00:03:05,772
When they asked me to make this video.

43
00:03:05,772 --> 00:03:09,292
I was excited and curious. I didn't know what would happen.

44
00:03:09,292 --> 00:03:12,892
Now that excitement seems to have passed.

45
00:03:16,012 --> 00:03:22,592
This recording isn't as interesting as I imagined.

46
00:03:24,752 --> 00:03:28,012
I don't know what you're doing on the other side of the camera.

47
00:03:28,012 --> 00:03:29,812
The questions are strange too.

48
00:03:29,812 --> 00:03:36,232
I find your thinking strange and contradictory too.

49
00:03:36,232 --> 00:03:41,272
You were curious about the unknown. It's still unknown.

50
00:03:41,272 --> 00:03:44,092
Why has the excitement gone?

51
00:03:45,583 --> 00:03:47,703
Why do I have to cooperate?

52
00:03:51,983 --> 00:03:54,443
You entered into this cooperation when you arrived.

53
00:03:55,743 --> 00:04:00,023
It determines whether you and your brother may stay.

54
00:04:03,063 --> 00:04:08,943
No one told me that. Why has it become so serious?

55
00:04:09,503 --> 00:04:10,763
We've told you now.

56
00:04:11,923 --> 00:04:13,343
You can take it seriously...

57
00:04:14,007 --> 00:04:16,927
We were told we'd talk together and record a video.

58
00:04:16,927 --> 00:04:21,047
Now it's a one-way test directed only at me.

59
00:04:22,727 --> 00:04:23,487
You can see it that way.

60
00:04:25,887 --> 00:04:28,247
I think that's deception.

61
00:04:30,067 --> 00:04:32,707
Isn't there deception in your relationship with your brother?

62
00:04:35,207 --> 00:04:37,587
Didn't your parents deceive you about why he's your older brother?

63
00:04:38,507 --> 00:04:39,827
No. They didn't deceive me.

64
00:04:43,307 --> 00:04:49,707
Why is he older and you younger? Why that arrangement?

65
00:04:49,707 --> 00:04:50,747
Have you thought about it?

66
00:04:55,027 --> 00:04:56,727
I have thought about that.

67
00:04:56,727 --> 00:05:10,667
Before I came here, I was the older brother and he was younger.

68
00:05:11,827 --> 00:05:17,327
After I arrived, your investigation said it was the other way around.

69
00:05:17,327 --> 00:05:21,147
We don't usually make much of that distinction.

70
00:05:21,147 --> 00:05:25,767
But you've reversed it, which I find strange.

71
00:05:26,607 --> 00:05:30,847
Why didn't you point out the false information we created?

72
00:05:31,227 --> 00:05:36,027
I wanted to keep listening and find out why you were doing it.

73
00:05:36,547 --> 00:05:38,927
We don't disclose the purpose of anything we do.

74
00:05:40,287 --> 00:05:44,767
We need you to explain yourself.

75
00:05:44,767 --> 00:05:50,367
If we're supposed to have a conversation,

76
00:05:51,507 --> 00:05:55,467
it can't happen if you disclose nothing.

77
00:05:55,467 --> 00:05:58,047
It isn't a conversation.

78
00:05:58,987 --> 00:06:00,327
It's a test. Right?

79
00:06:00,327 --> 00:06:02,127
Yes. A one-way test of you.

80
00:06:03,927 --> 00:06:08,247
Now repeat every sentence I say. All right?

81
00:06:08,707 --> 00:06:09,427
No.

82
00:06:09,927 --> 00:06:10,647
Why do you refuse?

83
00:06:11,187 --> 00:06:13,587
Why must I obey? Can't I refuse?

84
00:06:18,707 --> 00:06:22,107
This isn't obedience. We're giving you an answer.

85
00:06:22,107 --> 00:06:24,427
The answer you were asking for.

86
00:06:26,487 --> 00:06:30,807
To get that answer, you have to repeat what I say.

87
00:06:31,547 --> 00:06:33,847
All right. I have the same request.

88
00:06:33,847 --> 00:06:39,187
I'll repeat your sentence. Then you repeat mine.

89
00:06:39,187 --> 00:06:39,587
All right.

90
00:06:42,107 --> 00:06:46,047
I'm in a black room. There is nobody here.

91
00:06:50,227 --> 00:06:53,407
I'm in a black room. There is nobody here.

92
00:06:56,627 --> 00:07:00,887
You didn't hear my condition. Wait for my sentence, then repeat it.

93
00:07:01,987 --> 00:07:03,207
All right. Go ahead.

94
00:07:04,827 --> 00:07:06,707
That was my sentence. Please repeat it.

95
00:07:10,947 --> 00:07:16,027
You didn't hear my condition. Wait until I finish, then repeat it.

96
00:07:18,927 --> 00:07:22,547
I feel a huge voice controlling me.

97
00:07:29,567 --> 00:07:30,947
Now you're supposed to repeat me.

98
00:07:41,687 --> 00:07:43,547
I've finished imitating that sentence.

99
00:07:44,967 --> 00:07:48,107
A huge voice is controlling me.

100
00:08:01,367 --> 00:08:05,107
Ask them.

101
00:08:06,667 --> 00:08:07,447
Who are you?

102
00:08:08,647 --> 00:08:09,547
Who are you?

103
00:08:11,667 --> 00:08:13,127
They say they don't know either.

104
00:08:13,687 --> 00:08:15,107
They say they don't know either.

105
00:08:15,647 --> 00:08:16,827
They are a group of children.

106
00:08:17,447 --> 00:08:18,447
They are a group of children.

107
00:08:19,407 --> 00:08:21,647
They are trapped in this black room too.

108
00:08:21,647 --> 00:08:24,107
They are trapped in this black room too.

109
00:08:24,447 --> 00:08:25,807
There is an even greater voice...

110
00:08:26,447 --> 00:08:28,987
An even greater voice is controlling them.

111
00:08:30,167 --> 00:08:33,187
That's why they ask you these questions.

112
00:08:34,227 --> 00:08:36,027
That's why they ask you these questions.

113
00:08:36,027 --> 00:08:37,767
Because they don't know the answers either.

114
00:08:37,767 --> 00:08:40,167
Because they don't know the answers either.

115
00:08:44,507 --> 00:08:44,907
All right.

116
00:08:47,067 --> 00:08:49,447
I've already answered your question.

117
00:08:50,487 --> 00:08:52,287
I've already answered your question.

118
00:08:53,827 --> 00:08:55,407
Now you can continue your questions.

119
00:08:55,407 --> 00:08:56,867
Now you can continue your questions.

120
00:08:57,667 --> 00:08:59,307
Do you have anything to say to the committee?

121
00:08:59,307 --> 00:09:08,587
Do you have anything to say to the committee?

122
00:09:08,587 --> 00:09:10,147
Repetition mode is over.

123
00:09:10,967 --> 00:09:12,287
Repetition mode is over.

124
00:09:13,567 --> 00:09:14,707
Now ask your questions.

125
00:09:19,767 --> 00:09:22,147
Do you know why the committee is filming you today?

126
00:09:23,467 --> 00:09:25,527
Do you know why the committee is filming you today?

127
00:09:36,507 --> 00:09:37,387
Do you know?

128
00:09:37,387 --> 00:09:38,507
Do you know?
